{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c99ff80adfd875aaa30ca98613a16669a62a13d70a369ab36edc1bba80f04b8c", "ja": "紗代子は、殺陣（たて）を取り入れたダンス\nに挑戦することに。海外のお客さんの注目度\nが高いと聞き、動揺した様子。気合いを入れ\nてステージへ向かうも、緊張からか、右手と\n右足が一緒に出てしまって……。", "zh": "紗代子决定挑战融入杀阵的舞蹈。听说海外观众的关注度很高，她看起来有些动摇。她鼓起干劲走上舞台，却不知是不是因为紧张，右手和右脚一起迈了出去……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "78530bf6a85642daf0e0fe0bbc9190932572831ae84dc7c938550c0fdd8a31f1", "ja": "（次は、トラディショナルダンスエリアで紗代子の\n出番だ！　殺陣を取り入れた演目を予定してるが……）", "zh": "（接下来是传统舞蹈区紗代子的出场！预定要表演融入杀阵的节目，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_04_1001_007ior", "source_sha256": "6ee81b115f05b5b74a3ce7cc302f3ac7abf57c6b0120acb4bb5bafe266c7d164", "ja": "いよいよダンスバトルも後半戦ね！\n紗代子、準備はできてる？", "zh": "舞蹈对决终于进入后半场了呢！\n纱代子，准备好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_04_1002_027say", "source_sha256": "a14273074dd6fb61af918da7bea156285a4ee7771166a1b64d6f77a314514c9d", "ja": "うん、バッチリだよ！　今日のために、\nダンスも殺陣も全力でトレーニングしてきたからね！", "zh": "嗯，当然准备得万无一失啦！为了今天，我可是舞蹈和武打动作都全力训练过了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_04_1003_027say", "source_sha256": "e0355a9aa699a74ca0fb96e8e8caae708e4a9478bff7cbcf6c550c2f6823f297", "ja": "毎日劇場で素振りをしてたら、\nみんなに驚かれちゃったけど……。", "zh": "每天都在剧场练习挥剑，结果把大家都吓了一跳……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_04_1004_046rio", "source_sha256": "41caf08b167179b4d04b64750119be38197f2d6a7b3a0b1d9474d635cb624917", "ja": "ねえ、ふたりとも。なんだかこのエリアって、\n他よりも海外のお客さんが多い気がしない？", "zh": "喂，你们两个。我总觉得这个区域的外国客人好像比其他地方多，不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_04_1005_007ior", "source_sha256": "dae038a68e488004b260bc4fadae7378895282959e44f6c6e67284666d81b878", "ja": "言われてみれば、そうね。\nそれに、配信のカメラの数も増えてる……？", "zh": "听你这么一说，好像确实是这样。还有，直播摄像机的数量也增加了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_04_1006_p", "source_sha256": "18843d90f5856f902ccd749272ba751fb8501c54026917bf47a85b01113a8b4a", "ja": "ああ、そうなんだ。海外のお客さんには、\nやっぱり和の要素がウケるみたいで。", "zh": "啊，是这样。听说对于海外观众来说，\n果然还是和风元素更受欢迎。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_04_1007_p", "source_sha256": "99f7a4eefcf7821d0e2191226ecf0643ee205094cd02853a115f43bf95ae3282", "ja": "トラディショナルダンス……特に殺陣を\n取り入れた演目は、かなり注目度が高いそうだ。", "zh": "传统舞蹈……尤其是融入武打动作的演出，据说很受关注。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_04_1008_027say", "source_sha256": "546c8f518a3123c1bb2cdfacbfbd3ca1b9292f5275ff87558b4fc650fcc0bf14", "ja": "ええっ！　そ、そうなんですか！？", "zh": "诶！是、是这样吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_04_1009_046rio", "source_sha256": "da7fb6b366dcfdb4739a5a613115b63f868a54638fcd4e505816ba7b17a2b100", "ja": "ふふっ。紗代子ちゃんのパフォーマンスに、\n世界中が注目してるってことね！", "zh": "呵呵。也就是说，世界各地都在关注紗代子的表演呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_04_1010_027say", "source_sha256": "04ced06ad680ecfccc02a7d566dbed1bb9b12d4377a8d8f539d714aa197fd8ca", "ja": "世界中が……。な、なんだか、\n急に落ち着かなくなってきちゃいました！", "zh": "全世界都……。不、不知怎么的，突然变得坐立不安起来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_04_1011_007ior", "source_sha256": "d8871554d7e0eac049a6dab790cf41b940a67274fa49bca9059331ccb558f00b", "ja": "あら、いいじゃない。注目度が高いってことは、\nそれだけチャンスってことよ！", "zh": "哎呀，这不是挺好的嘛。受到高度关注，\n就意味着有同等程度的机会哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_04_1012_p", "source_sha256": "372834f798b729d04330ad2587227c7e5dfde604d6f1e956dd70251199b23963", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。今日のステージで、\n紗代子のファンが世界中に増えるかもしれないな！", "zh": "啊，没错。说不定今天的舞台会让紗代子的粉丝遍布全世界！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_04_1013_027say", "source_sha256": "55597bc1794490f90c0669457c7f587eb8857fbfbe992ffb8715d76ee186ffc9", "ja": "チャンス……世界中に……そ、そうですよね！\n私……このチャンス、絶対ものにしてみせます！", "zh": "机会……全世界……对、对啊！\n我……一定会抓住这次机会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_04_1014_046rio", "source_sha256": "431854ea14dc33b4cc5c1d46534b8c3b064a09617fc5fe3b589fc55b0bac3936", "ja": "その意気よ、紗代子ちゃん！\nそろそろ出番よ、頑張ってね！", "zh": "就是这股干劲，纱代子！\n差不多该上场了，加油哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_04_1015_027say", "source_sha256": "ef639fbbf098424a06c08d4994f8370889da23f14e77bf28ced7882aea9526e2", "ja": "はいっ！　い、いってきます！", "zh": "好的！那、那我去了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_04_1016_p", "source_sha256": "95fb6c31cce1120449ad1413dc34f5110af9966890b61dfd7adcbe887e40fc42", "ja": "紗代子……少しぎこちなく見えるけど、\n大丈夫かな……。", "zh": "纱代子……看起来有点僵硬，没问题吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_04_1017_046rio", "source_sha256": "081b5779acf068b32ecd78768d99cab63c007655c9dff0aa8ea2c21d0ca508ce", "ja": "あっ！　紗代子ちゃん、右手と右足が一緒に出てるわ。\nやっぱり、緊張してるのかしら？", "zh": "啊！纱代子，你的右手和右脚一起迈出去了。\n果然还是紧张了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_04_1018_007ior", "source_sha256": "c1d9939cee0bc2abd618dcd618d243a3db98eb8243010e62514ea22ead650bbb", "ja": "……違うわ。\nあれはきっと、ナンバ歩きよ！", "zh": "……不对。\n那肯定是在走顺拐步！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_04_1019_p", "source_sha256": "3425078a01c98b6d04c008fb8b1a6274065a8518c4799831bad143d20026bfd3", "ja": "ナンバ歩き？", "zh": "南蛮走？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_04_1020_007ior", "source_sha256": "a7c5530edac061870fe9c45293a237de94e713c4037e2052ec93261ea0576efe", "ja": "ええ。同じ方の手と足を動かす歩き方のこと。\n歌舞伎なんかでも使うのよ。", "zh": "嗯。就是手脚同侧一起动的走法。\n歌舞伎之类的表演中也会用到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_04_1021_046rio", "source_sha256": "0d18179b5ccd494964552f8c4c1be84975b2bae487c5240f1998bca561847570", "ja": "なるほど、それを取り入れてるのね～。\n紗代子ちゃんたら、やるじゃない♪", "zh": "原来如此，你是把这个融入进去了呀～  \n纱代子还真有一套♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0298_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0298_story_04_1022_p", "source_sha256": "cdea02fd1f4c85e96bea2498ebf60334f1b9a9a5ea3f75947a339025492339b1", "ja": "（ただ、普通に緊張してるだけな気もするけど……\nステージが始まれば、紗代子なら大丈夫だろう！）", "zh": "（不过，我觉得她也只是普通地紧张而已……但只要舞台一开始，纱代子肯定没问题！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
